.Dd August 5, 2026
.Dt POWEROF2 9
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm powerof2
.Nd test whether a value is a power of two
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In sys/param.h
.Fn powerof2 "x"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn powerof2
macro evaluates to a non-zero value if
.Fa x
is a power of two, and to zero otherwise.
It is equivalent to
.Li (((x) - 1) & (x)) == 0 .
.Pp
Note that
.Fn powerof2
also yields a non-zero value for
.Fa x
equal to zero.
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal
if (!powerof2(size))
    return (EINVAL);
.Ed
